Chapter: BlitName

 A LOCAL NAMED LIKE A BUILTIN. `wat-expr-calls-name` asks whether the name
 OCCURS, not whether it is CALLED, so an ordinary binding spelled
 `blit-framebuf` sets `needs-blit` and the module carries an `env` import that
 nothing can satisfy. It assembles; it fails at instantiation.

 Expected, and what the zig plug prints: 84.

  double : Integer -> Integer
  double (n) =
   let blit-framebuf = n * 2
   in blit-framebuf + blit-framebuf

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (double 21))
  end
